# OpenAI cuts the price of reasoning

OpenAI's newest reasoning model costs $2 per million input tokens, down about
60% on the last version. The launch happened on Tuesday, and the model is
available in the API now.

That price puts pressure on Anthropic and Google, who both cut prices in the
spring. Expect another round of cuts before the end of the year.

